# Package overlay working areas (PROPOSED_SPEC_CHANGES.md revision 2,
# "Automatic Classification, Flat Working Directory").
#
# A package directory's working area (packages/<pkg>/<flat files mirroring
# upstream paths>) is local editing scratch, regenerated into patches/ and
# files/ by `refresh` — it must never be committed. patches/, files/, and
# the per-package refresh manifest ARE the checked-in artifacts and must
# stay tracked.
#
# This file is scoped to packages/ only — it does not touch the top-level
# .gitignore (an upstream file) and has no effect on packages/forth-core/'s
# pre-existing, already-tracked files (ignore rules never affect files git
# already tracks).
*/*
!*/patches
!*/patches/**
!*/files
!*/files/**
!*/.refresh-manifest.json
